    "chunk_text": "Subject to the above suggestions, Section 59A(2) may be retained with appropriate amendments to empower the Commissioner to also give directives to Employers to pay the wages due to workers for work already executed under a disguised employment relationship, in addition to giving written directions to Employers to refrain from having work executed under a contract or arrangement which falls within the definition of disguised employment relationship.\n\nIn view of the above observations, please make the necessary amendments to the draft Bill and submit same for reconsideration in order to issue the Certificate of Constitutionality.\"\n\nSo, I think what has been suggested should be done. This piece of Legislation would have been brought in good faith, but these issues have constantly been raised by a number of trade unions including the Ceylon Federation of Labour. Now that the Attorney General has also raised this matter, could the Hon. Minister consider making an appropriate amendment at the Committee Stage?\n\nThank you.\n\n447 448\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014 * }\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0dd9p \u0dad\u0db6\u0dcf \u0d87\u0dad. * \u0001\u0ba9\u0bbf\u0bc8\u0bb2\u0baf\u0007\u0ba4\u0bbf \u0bc8\u0bb5 \u0b95\u000e\u0baa\u0010\u0011\u0012\u0bb3\u0014. * Placed in the Library.\n\n\u0db4\u0dcf*+\u0dd9\u0012',\u0dc0\n\n\u0d9c #\u0dd9\u0dba>\u0da2J \u0d9a\u0dae\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a9\u0db8\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe'(\u0bae\u0bbf \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0ba4\u0bbf\" \u0b9a\u0baa\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0007 \u0b85\u0bb5\u0007\u0b95%) (The Hon. Deputy Speaker) Next, the Hon. (Mrs.) Shanthi Sriskandarasa. You have ten minutes. Before that, will an Hon. Member propose the Hon. (Mrs.) Sriyani Wijewickrama to the Chair? \u0d9c \u0dbd*\u0dc2\u0dca\u0db8/ eQ\u0d87C\u0dbd \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe'(\u0bae\u0bbf \u0bb2<\u0bae\u0017 \u0b95\u0bbf\u0bbe\u0bbf\u0b8e=\u0bb2) (The Hon. Lakshman Kiriella) Sir, I pr