    "md5": "26f99e7c888f826dd1da8cbf21537819",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2015,
    "chunk_text": "Inter-terminal operations are far too slow. I think we need to have a reality check into our shipping industry because a sense of inefficiency and lethargy has crept in, which needs to be corrected with immediate effect. The delays in inter-terminal transfers are so long that delays in handling ships are also taking place and that is a concern for the shipping industry. So, I think we need to ensure that this type of things are checked, looked at and corrected immediately. We need to have a professional team. If we are unable to discharge the services owing to lack of forethought or planning, let us ensure that efficiency is brought in so that we do not lose the opportunity that is before us.\n\n\u0dc0\u0dd2\u0db4\u0dca\u0dc2\u0dc2\u0dca\u0da8\u0dc1 \u0db8\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3\u0dca\u0dc4\u0dd4\u0db1\u0dca ECT \u0d91 \u0d9c\u0dd1\u0dc3 \u0dc0\u0dbb \u0dba\u0dc3 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0da7 \u0dc1\u0db4\u0dde\u0dda\u0d9c\u0dbd\u0dd2 \u0dba\u0dda \u0d9c\u0dd1\u0dc3 \u0dc0\u0dbb \u0dc5\u0dbb. \u200d\u0dbb\u0dc0\u0db8 \u0dca\u0dad\u0dbb\u0dca\u0da7 \u0dc1\u0db8\u0dca \u0dca\u0dc2\u0dc1\u0dc2\u0dca\u0da8\u0dda\u200d\u0dbb\n\n633 634\n\n\u0db4\u0dbb\u0dae\u0dd2\u0dbd\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0db8\u0dca\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dca\n\nand that will result in a bigger capacity handled out of Sri Lanka. These are the elements that we have got to look at.\n\nI am happy that the Hambantota Port is now coming into operation. We had an idle port and it certainly is a step in the right direction to commercialize it instead of just having a white elephant, saying that we have a port but not having a single container handled via that. We see vibrancy coming through that. That is the way we need to take our shipping industry forward. The Oluvil Port also needs to be put into commercialization. We have some other ports. The Galle Port,too, should be looked at from a more commercial-oriented way. I call upon the Hon. Minister to ensure that officials with a thinking of commercialization put into each port and a target given to them with productivity as the most important aspect, competitiveness as its key word as well as ensuring there is automation, technology development, speed of handling and a modernization approach to be brought into Sri Lankan ports."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_hansard_2010s",
    "doc_id": "2019-09-18-2019-09-18",
